  "modelTags": "PMDco,Testing,Characterisation,MechanicalTesting,OBI",
  "title": "Smart Data Models - PMD Core Ontology - Assay",
  "description": "A planned process that has the objective to produce information about a material entity (the evaluant) by examining it. (PMD Core Ontology 3.1.2 class 'assay', http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000070. Entity type and attribute names are the PascalCase / camelCase forms of the English rdfs:labels; context.jsonld maps them to the PMDco, BFO, RO, IAO and OBI IRIs.)",
  "type": "object",
