      "description": "Property. Not a PMDco term (Smart Data Models addition) standing for rdf:type: the PMDco classes this entity is an instance of, given by their English rdfs:label, verbatim. Enum of the 62 non-deprecated classes of the 'assay' branch (obo:OBI_0000070, the root and all subclasses in PMDco 3.1.2, including subclasses that PMDco only states through owl:intersectionOf). Several values are allowed (e.g. a material that is both 'steel' and 'structural material')."
    },
    "hasSpecifiedInput": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "uri"
      },
      "description": "Relationship. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000293'. PMDco 'has specified input': The inverse property of is specified input of Points to the Object (test piece) or Material entities examined (the evaluant)."
    },
    "hasSpecifiedOutput": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "uri"
      },
      "description": "Relationship. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000299'. PMDco 'has specified output': The inverse property of is specified output of Points to the MeasurementDatum entities that the assay produces."
    },
    "hasParticipant": {
