        "type": "string",
        "format": "uri"
      },
      "description": "Relationship. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000057'. PMDco 'has participant': a relation between a process and a continuant, in which the continuant is somehow involved in the process Points to Device entities (and agents such as Organization entities) that take part in the process."
