          "hasSpecifiedNumericValue": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Property. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001937'. PMDco 'has specified numeric value': A relation between a value specification and a number that quantifies it. The number of the scalar value specification."
          },
          "hasMeasurementUnitLabel": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "Property. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000039'. PMDco 'has measurement unit label'. The unit IRI. PMDco does not define units itself; its patterns use QUDT (http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/...) or UO units. QUDT unit IRIs are recommended, e.g. http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MegaPA."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "processAttribute",
          "hasSpecifiedNumericValue"
        ]
      },
      "description": "Property. Model:'https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000009'. PMDco 'has process attribute': A relation between a process and a process attribute that depends on it. Flattened: each item gives the process attribute class (e.g. heating rate, deformation speed), the number and the unit."
    },
    "hasFirstInstant": {
      "type": "string",
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "format": "date-time"
        },
        {
          "format": "date"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Property. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000222'. PMDco/BFO 'has first instant': the first instant of the temporal interval that the process occupies. Flattened from the PMDco 'temporal region' pattern (process occupies temporal region, which has first/last instant, given by time:inXSDDateTime). ISO 8601 date-time, or a date when only the day is known."
    },
    "hasLastInstant": {
      "type": "string",
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "format": "date-time"
        },
        {
          "format": "date"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Property. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000224'. PMDco/BFO 'has last instant': the last instant of the temporal interval that the process occupies. Flattened from the PMDco 'temporal region' pattern (process occupies temporal region, which has first/last instant, given by time:inXSDDateTime). ISO 8601 date-time, or a date when only the day is known."
    },
    "precededBy": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "uri"
      },
      "description": "Relationship. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000062'. PMDco 'preceded by': x is preceded by y if and only if the time point at which y ends is before or equivalent to the time point at which x starts. Formally: x preceded by y iff ω(y) <= α(x), where α is a function that maps a process to a start point, and ω is a function that maps a process to an end point. Points to ManufacturingProcess or Assay entities that come before this one in a process chain."
    },
    "precedes": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "uri"
      },
      "description": "Relationship. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000063'. PMDco 'precedes': x precedes y if and only if the time point at which x ends is before or equivalent to the time point at which y starts. Formally: x precedes y iff ω(x) <= α(y), where α is a function that maps a process to a start point, and ω is a function that maps a process to an end point. Points to ManufacturingProcess or Assay entities that come after this one in a process chain."
    },
    "isSubjectOf": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "description": "Property. Model:'https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000004'. PMDco 'is subject of': Inverse of 'is about'. Flattened: in PMDco the process is subject of (and realizes a plan that concretizes) a directive information entity such as a test standard or a plan specification; here each item is the title or designation of that document (e.g. DIN EN ISO 6892-1)."
    },
